:: stage2-BFGRecap-vn-transcript-eng [nobr]
<p>Transcript:</p>
<p>So, there’s a little girl called Sophie, who is snatched from her orphanage by the BFG, a friendly giant, who collects and delivers sweet dreams to children with a special trumpet. The BFG carries Sophie back to faraway Giant Country. Unlike the 9 other terrifying and enormous giants who eat humans, the BFG lives on Snozzcumbers. </p>

<p>
    Sophie and BFG form an unlikely friendship and BFG teaches Sophie about how he keeps dreams in jars. 
    
</p>
<p>They hatch a brave plan to stop the human-eating giants by delivering a dream to the Queen that will help prove their existence. When the Queen wakes up, Sophie is in her bedroom, further confirming the truth of the dream. </p>

<p>With the support of the army, they travel back to Giant Country and capture the man-eating ? giants with helicopters.The giants are taken away and the BFG is deemed the ‘Royal Dream-Blower’.</p>

